# Stripe's publishable key (safe to expose client-side -- that's what it's
# for) -- only used on /website-approval/:token to complete a 3D Secure
# challenge inline via stripe.confirmCardPayment when a bank requires it on
# the $5 setup-fee charge. Find it in the Stripe Dashboard: Developers > API
# keys > Publishable key (starts with pk_test_... or pk_live_...).
REACT_APP_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
